Visuals, all computed from the registers at render time (no chart lib):
- StackDiagram   eleven layers + occupants per layer (hatched = not built),
                 deterministic-gate bracket; on / (compact) and /architecture
- MissionCoverage entry × stage grid from `stages`; 4 of 7 stages covered,
                 ACT/RECOVER/LEARN empty and counted as gaps
- DependencyGraph layered graph from `dependsOn`, crossing-reduced ordering
- KpiCoverage    12 hatched cells on / replacing the full table
- Timeline       dated evidence (PyPI releases, commit, decisions, due
                 dates) with source per event + data table; lane layout
- EvidenceGrid   16 palletizer test modules mapped onto the stack layers
- StatusBar      status distribution as labelled segments
- ContractFlow   three clusters, four versioned contracts as arrows
Every figure carries <title>+<desc>; axe 0 violations at 1280/390.

Information model: RegistryEntry gains stages, layers, dependsOn (closed
vocabularies MISSION, LAYERS in types.ts); evidence.ts adds the dated
timeline + test map; registry/[id] shows depends-on / used-by / stages /
layers. Simulation and controller descriptions corrected to what the
repo contains (OPC UA robot mock, UR bridge example).

Consistency: SubNav register rail on every register page with
aria-current; KPI rows addressable (#kpi-<id>); card tagline aligned in
all four dictionaries; /registry#deps linked from /constitution;
responsive stacked tables below 640 px; print stylesheet for /report.

Execution stack: GITHUB_TOKEN support in github.ts (fail-safe unchanged);
/api/cluster/registry now static + /api/cluster/registry/[id] (SSG) and
exposes missionCoverage + dependencyEdges; /report.md (latest report as
Markdown); scripts/new-week.mjs scaffolds the next report with TODO
bodies that verify.sh refuses to ship.

verify.sh: 126 contracts (+ visual contract: figures present, every svg
described, rail current-marker on all register pages, no TODO on
/report; register JSON: no dangling dependsOn, known stages/layers).
Build 59 pages; typecheck, lint clean.

